id: normal
name: Normal
kind: battlefield
lightLevel: 0
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Ordinary light. Nothing is changed.
text: >
  * Normal (0). No effect.

---

# No script, because the entry says "no effect" - and a passive that does nothing still
# shows up in the workings claiming to have done something.
#
# The file exists all the same. It is what the sheet names when there is nothing wrong with
# the light, and a Light Level with no file would be a hole in the middle of a table of
# five.
